Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a component and an example application. It does not
vendor its dependencies; it is built against them.

  Matter SDK (project-chip/connectedhomeip)   Apache-2.0
  Zephyr RTOS                                 Apache-2.0
  OpenThread                                  BSD-3-Clause
  nRF Connect SDK (nrfconnect/sdk-nrf)        LicenseRef-Nordic-5-Clause
  nRF Door Lock and Access Control Add-on     LicenseRef-Nordic-5-Clause

`examples/lock/` derives its Kconfig and board files from Nordic Semiconductor
sample configuration and retains Nordic's SPDX headers and copyright where the
original text survives. Those files remain under LicenseRef-Nordic-5-Clause,
which permits use with Nordic Semiconductor integrated circuits.

Everything under `lib/tunnel/`, `zap/VendorTunnelCluster.xml`,
`zap/add_tunnel_cluster.py`, `measure/` and `tools/` is original work by the
copyright holder and is Apache-2.0.

The example application compiles the upstream door lock application's sources
*in place* rather than copying them, so no Nordic application source is
redistributed here. Obtain it from:

  https://github.com/nrfconnect/ncs-door-lock-and-access-control

Device attestation certificates under `evidence/test-vectors/` are Matter
*test* credentials (VID 0xFFF1) from the public Matter SDK development PKI.
They are not production credentials and confer no attestation of conformance.
